Z||000011||1FST2M6||03-30-2001||06:05 PM||||yes you can use the sprint manifold with this kit...<P><BR>I'll e-mail ya tomingt.. i've got a Date with the owner of <A HREF="http://www.teamzetec.com" TARGET=_blank>www.teamzetec.com</A>  tomorrow at the shop.. you tied up sunday? maybe we could hook up and figure out your plumbing issues..  Water injections would be ok.. but intercooling and water injection is better.. and the correct injection system uses 60+PSI to make sure the water does'nt puddle and cause more problems than you had before... I've got an intercooler and the shop has 3 others.. i'm sure we can figure somthing out.. my air canister area is EMPTY i'll make brackets and what not to fit my car and we'll just have to run plumbing on yours! POOF! colder charge air. and more HP...  now just to fix your lean issues... humm... <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 03-30-2001).]||||reg||1
